{"seq":3,"slug":"raft-safety-membership","title":"安全性与成员变更","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/consensus-algorithms-raft-paxos/raft/raft-safety-membership","wordCount":1897,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"安全性与成员变更\">安全性与成员变更</h1><p>前两篇把 Raft 怎么选主、怎么复制讲清楚了，但还欠一笔最关键的债：凭什么相信它真的对？凭什么一条已经回复给客户端「成功」的命令，绝不会在某次领导者更替后凭空消失或被改写？这就是 Raft 安全性要证明的「状态机安全特性」。另外，真实集群要扩容、缩容、换机器，成员名单本身也得在不停机的情况下安全地变更——这是另一个极易引入双领导者灾难的雷区。本篇把这两块硬骨头啃完，Raft 的拼图才算完整。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Raft 的安全性建立在五条相互支撑的特性之上，它们层层递进，最终汇成「状态机安全」这一终极保证。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  EL[&quot;选举安全&lt;br/&gt;每任期至多一个领导者&quot;] --&gt; SMS[&quot;状态机安全&lt;br/&gt;已应用的条目&lt;br/&gt;所有副本一致且永不改变&quot;]&#10;  LAO[&quot;领导者只追加&lt;br/&gt;从不删改自己日志&quot;] --&gt; SMS&#10;  LM[&quot;日志匹配&lt;br/&gt;同索引同任期⟹之前全同&quot;] --&gt; LC&#10;  LR[&quot;选举限制&lt;br/&gt;只选日志最新的候选者&quot;] --&gt; LC[&quot;领导者完整性&lt;br/&gt;已提交条目必在&lt;br/&gt;未来所有领导者日志中&quot;]&#10;  LC --&gt; SMS\">flowchart TD\n  EL[\"选举安全&lt;br/&gt;每任期至多一个领导者\"] --&gt; SMS[\"状态机安全&lt;br/&gt;已应用的条目&lt;br/&gt;所有副本一致且永不改变\"]\n  LAO[\"领导者只追加&lt;br/&gt;从不删改自己日志\"] --&gt; SMS\n  LM[\"日志匹配&lt;br/&gt;同索引同任期⟹之前全同\"] --&gt; LC\n  LR[\"选举限制&lt;br/&gt;只选日志最新的候选者\"] --&gt; LC[\"领导者完整性&lt;br/&gt;已提交条目必在&lt;br/&gt;未来所有领导者日志中\"]\n  LC --&gt; SMS</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>安全特性</th>\n<th>保证内容</th>\n<th>由什么机制实现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>选举安全</td>\n<td>一个任期至多一个领导者</td>\n<td>每任期每节点至多一票 + 多数派相交</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>领导者只追加</td>\n<td>领导者绝不删改自己已有条目</td>\n<td>协议规定单向操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日志匹配</td>\n<td>同索引同任期则之前全相同</td>\n<td>AppendEntries 一致性检查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>领导者完整性</td>\n<td>已提交条目必出现在未来所有领导者日志里</td>\n<td>选举限制 + 提交规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态机安全</td>\n<td>各副本在同一索引应用相同命令</td>\n<td>以上四条共同推出</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"选举限制-为什么它是安全性的支点\">选举限制：为什么它是安全性的支点</h2><p>回忆 <a href=\"raft-leader-election\">Raft 领导选举</a> 里那条「只投票给日志至少和自己一样新的候选者」的选举限制。当时说它是安全性基石，现在揭晓为什么。</p>\n<p>考虑一条已提交的条目 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span>。「已提交」意味着 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span> 被复制到了一个多数派 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 上。现在假设要选出一个新领导者,它必须从某个多数派 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>Q</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9463em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 收集选票。由多数派相交,<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>∩</mo><msup><mi>Q</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q \\cap Q&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9463em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 非空,存在一个节点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 同时在两个集合里——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 既持有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span>,又给新领导者投了票。而选举限制规定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 只会投给「日志至少和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 一样新」的候选者,这意味着新领导者的日志至少和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 一样新,因此新领导者也必然包含 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span>(或更新的、覆盖了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span> 位置的条目,但因 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span> 已提交,日志匹配特性保证那个位置就是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span>)。</p>\n<p>把这个论证形式化,就得到领导者完整性(Leader Completeness):任何已提交的条目,必然出现在所有更高任期的领导者日志中。换句话说,新领导者绝不可能「不知道」一条已提交的命令。这正是 Raft 相对 <a href=\"../paxos/multi-paxos\">Multi-Paxos</a> 的简化精髓——Multi-Paxos 的新领导者要「上任补洞」,主动去恢复可能遗漏的已选定值;Raft 干脆用选举限制从源头保证新领导者不会遗漏,把恢复逻辑前置进了投票规则里。一条选举限制,省掉了一整套补洞协议。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从领导者完整性到状态机安全\">从领导者完整性到状态机安全</h2><p>有了领导者完整性,推出最终的状态机安全(State Machine Safety)就顺理成章:如果某个副本已经把索引 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 处的条目应用到了状态机,那么其它任何副本在索引 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 处应用的必然是同一条命令。</p>\n<p>证明的关键是把 <a href=\"raft-log-replication\">日志复制</a> 里那条微妙的提交规则接上。一个条目被应用,前提是它被提交;它被提交,要么是当前任期领导者直接提交(已复制到多数派),要么是被一条当前任期的新条目连带提交。无论哪种,提交时它都在某领导者日志的某位置。由领导者完整性,这个已提交条目会出现在所有后续领导者的日志中,且由日志匹配特性,它在所有这些日志里的索引和内容都相同。既然没有任何后续领导者会改动它,而只有领导者能改日志,这条已提交条目就被「钉死」了——所有副本最终在同一索引应用同一命令,状态机永不分叉。这就闭合了 <a href=\"../foundations/consensus-problem\">共识问题</a> 要求的协定性。这也解释了为什么「领导者只能直接提交当前任期条目」那条限制不可或缺:少了它,一个旧任期条目可能在多数派上却仍被覆盖,领导者完整性的链条就会断裂。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成员变更-联合共识与单节点变更\">成员变更:联合共识与单节点变更</h2><p>集群要换机器、扩缩容,成员配置(谁是合法投票者)本身得变。直接「一刀切」从旧配置 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{old}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 跳到新配置 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{new}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是危险的:在切换的瞬间,不同节点可能用不同配置算「多数派」,旧配置的一个多数派和新配置的一个多数派可能毫无交集,于是同一任期里旧配置选出一个领导者、新配置选出另一个——双领导者,安全性崩塌。</p>\n<p>Raft 原论文给出联合共识(joint consensus)方案:引入一个过渡配置 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{old,new}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>,在这个阶段,任何决定(选举和日志提交)都必须同时获得旧配置和新配置各自的多数派同意。集群先从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{old}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 切到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{old,new}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>(这本身作为一条日志条目提交),稳定后再切到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{new}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。过渡期的「双多数派」约束保证了不可能同时存在分属新旧配置、互不重叠的两个领导者,堵死了双领导者的口子。联合共识通用但实现繁琐,所以工业界(包括 etcd)更常用一种简化:单节点变更(single-server change)——每次只增加或删除一个节点。因为一次只动一个,新旧配置的任意两个多数派必然相交(可以证明只差一个节点时交集不空),于是无需过渡配置就能保证安全,实现简单得多。代价是批量换机器要拆成多次单步操作。这两种方案的工程取舍,在 <a href=\"../practice/consensus-in-practice\">工程实现 etcd/ZooKeeper</a> 里会结合 etcd 的实际 ConfChange 接口再看。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Raft 安全性由五条特性层层推出,终点是状态机安全:所有副本在同一索引应用相同命令、永不分叉。</li>\n<li>选举限制(只选日志最新的候选者)是支点:配合多数派相交,推出领导者完整性——新领导者必含所有已提交条目,从而免去 Multi-Paxos 的「上任补洞」。</li>\n<li>状态机安全 = 领导者完整性 + 日志匹配 + 提交规则 + 领导者只追加;「只直接提交当前任期条目」是不可缺的一环,否则链条断裂。</li>\n<li>成员变更直接切换会因新旧多数派不相交而产生双领导者;联合共识用过渡配置的「双多数派」约束防止,单节点变更则靠「一次只动一个⟹多数派必相交」简化,etcd 等多采用后者。</li>\n<li>至此 Raft 拼图完整:选主定唯一权威、复制走主航道、安全性证明正确、成员变更保证动态可扩。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub:<a href=\"raft-log-replication\">日志复制</a> — 本篇的提交规则正是日志复制里 commitIndex 推进的安全依据。</li>\n<li>同 hub:<a href=\"../paxos/basic-paxos\">基本 Paxos</a> — 对照 Paxos 如何用同样的多数派相交保证安全。</li>\n<li>跨 hub:<a href=\"../../distributed-coordination-services/systems/etcd-raft\">etcd 与 Raft</a> — 成员变更与安全性在 etcd 生产系统中的接口与实践。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"安全性与成员变更","id":"安全性与成员变更"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"选举限制：为什么它是安全性的支点","id":"选举限制-为什么它是安全性的支点"},{"level":2,"text":"从领导者完整性到状态机安全","id":"从领导者完整性到状态机安全"},{"level":2,"text":"成员变更:联合共识与单节点变更","id":"成员变更-联合共识与单节点变更"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"日志复制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/consensus-algorithms-raft-paxos/raft/raft-log-replication"},"next":{"title":"工程实现 etcd/ZooKeeper","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/consensus-algorithms-raft-paxos/practice/consensus-in-practice"}}